    relevanceScore: 86,
    text: "Edit: Sean please. We have money. Let us pay you for these updates   This game will go down in the annals of Gaming history as being one of the best turnarounds of the gaming industry. From the lackluster beginnings to the monster of a game it is now, Hello Games has shown us that they are truly sorry for what they did with this game and are determined to redeem themselves. No man\u0027s sky is one of the best, if not the best, exploration based games I have ever seen, from huge freighter battles to simply watching the local fauna. Journey to find out who you are, who the Atlas is, and what exactly the problem is that plagues the universe. After a year of it being crapped on by gamers all over the globe, I wholeheartedly believe that the version we have now was the version we were promised all those years ago.   Happy travels, my friends.   Edit:  Sean, please. we have money.",
