    text: "With the NEXT update right around the corner, I can only say this to the Devs- GG EZ Clutch!  Huge respect for not abandoning this opportunity, now the game has places to explore, story to follow, things to build, and money to save for Frigate.  Bigger and more beautiful than ever, the game feels as it was promised and with their biggest update coming in a few days, it\u0027s a definite buy.  Whether you want to follow story, explore the vast and beautiful universe, become space pirate or scientist, to grow crops from other planets, solar systems and galaxies, places with resources that are rare to find, the world is your oyster.    Then you can fight your way to glory, by salvaging, upgrading and finally purchasing a damn Frigate!  In any way, this game is fun and with the added multiplayer, if done correctly it will be a huge success!",
