    text: "Was pretty bad and disapointing at launch. Nowm, it\u0027s a pretty good game. I\u0027m waiting for the \"NEXT\" patch and i\u0027m super excited for it, i\u0027ve seen all the leaks and they\u0027ve changed the game enough for it to be a worthy purchase now. creatuyres look cool now and everything. I think that people still crying about what happened 2 years ago need to seriously grow up. They\u0027ve given us two years of free quality updates now, no it doesn\u0027t change what they\u0027ve done but it certainly shows that they\u0027re not taking our money and running, it shows they want to fix the wrong they\u0027ve done. and if we don\u0027t promote people trying to fix their mistakes then what kind of people are we exactly? This game is good now and I haven\u0027t even played NEXT. I\u0027ll probably update this review after NEXT update but considering the game is already good, and the update is looking so much better, i highly doubt this review is going to become negative.",
