    createdAt: '2017-08-11',
    reviewScore: 53,
    relevanceScore: 85,
    text: "I\u0027ve been playing No Man\u0027s Sky since the Pathfinder update and have always found it an extremely fun and relaxing exploration experience. Since the latest 1.3 update, Atlas Rises, it has become such an amazing game. There\u0027s tons more stuff to do with all the added story and lore and the game looks even better than it did before the update.  If you\u0027ve been holding out on buying No Man\u0027s Sky due to the negative reviews it has gotten since launch, now is the time to jump on board. There is more planned for the game and the best thing about the updates is not that they are free, but with each and every one, the game continues to get better and better.  I\u0027d highly recommend No Man\u0027s Sky to anyone!",
