    funny: 3,
    createdAt: '2022-07-27',
    reviewScore: 42,
    relevanceScore: 85,
    text: "I had very much liked NMS before Waypoint 4.0 where I would at least keep it installed to see what\u0027s new. However, now with the latest update anyone who had a lot of tech upgrades practically lost all previous capability such as hyperdrive distance and maneuverability because tech only goes to tech now and existing players weren\u0027t given any sort of in-game tokens to allow full tech space usage. I can\u0027t tell how many hours I (and i\u0027m sure countless others) have pumped into getting max inventory spaces for exosuit, main ship, and freighter which is now rendered pointless. I understood past inventory changes and recommending new saves but with the (long ago now) addition of quicksilver and save specific quicksilver rewards instead of account specific rewards makes it difficult to move on to a new save and dump another ridiculous amount of hours just to get back to where I was.",
