    sentiment: 'positive',
    helpful: 6,
    funny: 0,
    createdAt: '2017-08-11',
    reviewScore: 80,
    relevanceScore: 84,
    text: "(New Review)  After all the updates released this is probably the best bang for your buck game out there right now. I have purchased this game multiple times on plenty of other platforms and I always enjoy playing it. There is no other game quite like no mans sky. I have searched for years to find a game that gives me the same feeling as this game does whenever I play it. The only game I have found so far is star citizen and even then there is no comparing the two other than the space travel. It truly feels like you can do whatever you want in this game. I highly recommend picking this game up and giving it a shot. Even if it is not your favorite game, I believe you will have the same appreciation for it as many others do.   (Old Review)  The next update just released and I have heard that it is good unfortunately I cannot fully review it yet because I am on vacation but will be the first thing I play when I get home it was great to see this game evolve into what it is and it was a fun trip. My friends would always laugh at me when I told them this game was actually good, they were too busy riding the bandwagon many others who never played the game followed. I\u0027m happy to see this game thriving again and I am going to say what many other people have already said... I\u0027m glad the devs took the time to forge this game into what they wanted it to be instead of abandoning it. They really did an amazing job. What made the game so special when the game was empty was the community. Everyone working together to create the Galactic Hub and to be apart of someting special. If you want a game to chill out and have a nice time exploring to your hearts content then buy this game you will not be disappointed  (Older Review)  think of this game like an early access game. Don\u0027t go into it thinking it is going to be the greatest experience of your life. It is a great game but there are many things that I think could be fixed and im sure are being fixed. I bought the game knowing all of this and honestly I\u0027m not disapointed. It is a very fun experience for the first couple hours (at least when I bought it) But soon I found that there was nothing else to do. With the new Atlas update it is clear that the studio really does care about this game and when they update the game they really update it. I don\u0027t think this game should be $60 but if you can get it for around $20 then i say go for it if you are looking to sit in the back seat of hello games car and ride along for the journey. Honestly a good game and it is nice to see that the developers didn\u0027t just run away with our money",
