    reviewScore: 52,
    relevanceScore: 84,
    text: "No Man\u0027s Sky is actually my favorite, so I could talk about it for hours, but I\u0027ll try to keep it short. If you want a chill, beautiful, never-gets-old exploration experience, buy this game! Infinite planets, infinite creatures, etc. I realize that the \"no multiplayer\" has thrown a lot of people off, but honestly, the game is fantastic without interaction, and the new VOIP system is still amazing. Also, there are multiple discords and subredits where peopel talk about the game, so if you really want to enjoy the game with other people, that works quite well. I\u0027ve played about a hundred hours, and have built an incredible base on a planet with spectacular mountains and fauna, an I\u0027ve only scratched the surface. Definitely recommend!",
