    text: "Let\u0027s get the elephant in the room out of the way first: having played since release, yes they botched the launch, yes the game wasn\u0027t initially worth the money, and yes it was incomplete. But the dev team, to their immense credit, has powered out a ton of improvements and wholesale changes to the game to make it whay we all expected.  I\u0027ve only got 58 hours in the game but those are some of the most chill, interesting, and unique hours I\u0027ve spent in any game. You can do most anything you\u0027d like at this point, as of 1.32. Grab a beer, relax, and go explore the universe these guys created.",
