    relevanceScore: 83,
    text: "I am sure that I am not the first to point this out, but this game hase improved a lot since its launch, and it will only improve from here. Currently, I find the story enjoyable. Though it could use a bit more. More destinations that is. I think that there is currently just not enough reason to explore. If you are not convinced that it is worth a buy now, wait until the \"NEXT\" update. For me, the addition of multiplayer will provide what is missing, games are allways better with friends.  (Post \"NEXT\" Review): They did it. They definately did it! They pulled off the biggest comeback in gaming history! If you don\u0027t want to buy this game now then who are you?  (A little later): I am addicted now. The multiplayer is great. A+  (Post 1.7): Wow they just keep coming out with new free content dont they?  (Beyond): Bruh, just buy the game already.",
