    relevanceScore: 82,
    text: "♥♥♥♥♥ good, the updates really added a lot and im glad hello games never gave up on their dream  edit about a year later: they\u0027re still updating the game and making large improvements, and are even adding the feature everyone wanted but we didnt get: multiplayer.  the game launch was a dumpster fire, but hello games has really redeemed themselves and showed that they are a good developer by keeping the game updated even when the entire online community hated the game.",
