    relevanceScore: 82,
    text: "A year ago, this game was nothing more than a glorified tech demo.  Now that it\u0027s gotten an update to the content and mechanics, it\u0027s finally looking like a game. It has a tiered progression system, it\u0027s not easy to grind to endgame in terms of easy \"exploits\" to net better and better ships or units to upgrade your exosuit easily, and you actually have to do some of the content to get the initial blueprints to progress deeper into the game, such as other weapon modes for your multitool and weapons for your starship. It has finally gotten good and is worth the money. Maybe still not $60 at this point, but catch it on a sale and have fun with it.",
