    text: "I am incredibly impressed with where this game is at. I had pre-ordered it last Spring but refunded it during the summer sale with the intention of re-preordering. Near it\u0027s release I decided just to wait and boy was I happy I did. I went on ignoring this game until I noticed it heavily discounted with the release of the Atlus update. I decided to give it a shot due to my adoration of space and exploration and all of the positive reviews I saw it was getting. I reiterate my previous statement, I am incredibly impressed and blown away with how much fun this game is. It\u0027s obviously not for everyone but it has gone above and beyond my expectations and I highly recommend to anybody into exploration and needs some relaxing activity.  EDIT: Still a great game that continues to be improved time and time again! NEXT knocked it out of the park with all of the new additions",
