    text: "Patch 1.3 is how the game should have released. They ♥♥♥♥♥♥ up. It happens A LOT, especially these days. But, they actually stuck through all the hate to make a better game. They could have taken our money and ran, but didn\u0027t. After 200+ hours on PS4, I bought it on PC to show my continued support.",
