    text: "This game has really come a long way in the past year. Combined with some of the popular mods such as the Common Traveler\u0027s Edition, Sprint/Jetpack and Flight Speed increases, and some of the visual and planet diversity mods, it\u0027s a lot closer to what was originally advertised all those years ago. It\u0027s still not perfect, but you have to give the devs credit for supporting the game. We\u0027ve been getting near weekly patch updates that amount to not just bug fixes, but minor new features with most of the patches.   I returned the game on launch, but picked it up on sale recently. For $24, I\u0027ve had a lot of fun with the game so far. It still is somewhat grindy, but mods address that quite well and help to speed the pace up and let you spend less time mining for resources just to get the next upgrade or to refill fuel.",
