    text: "I bought this game for €24 on sale and I don\u0027t consider it worth the price. What I did for the first 3 hours: - Wait in a 5 minute \"loading shaders\" screen - Spent the next 3 hours collecting resources in extremely repetitive manner - Get a hyperdrive - Dealt with sub-par ship controls - Feel incredibly isolated due to no voice acting at all  By the time I hit my second solar system I just ALT+F4\u0027d it.  There are much better open-world survivor games out there right now. It might be worth €15 or under. Not terrible, but not woth €24, definitely not worth €50.",
