    reviewScore: 86,
    relevanceScore: 80,
    text: "I love redemption, especially in video games. The usual narrative is: Big publisher greedy and bad, let\u0027s troll and bag on their game, and feel good about ourselves for piling on with other disgruntled nerds that we gave a game an overwhelmingly negative review. NMS is a testament to Devs who didn\u0027t listen to the hate, and improved a good game to make it great. It\u0027s not perfect, but a very enjoyable and engaging space exploration experience. I\u0027m glad I didn\u0027t believe the negative hate machine and judged the game for myself, first on PS4, and now on Steam. You will be glad you jumped in too. Thank you Hello Games for sticking by this game to making all that it could be.",
