    relevanceScore: 80,
    text: "I\u0027m one of the few ones who are wasn\u0027t devastated by the initial release of NMS. Mainly because I hadn\u0027t heard of it, didn\u0027t follow all the previews and so my expectations were for moderately entertaining game. Was $60 worth it back then? I\u0027d say no, and so I understand a lot of the anger. However, with the latest update HG has shown their dedication to the game; even in the face of unprecedented opposition from the public. The game is beautiful, there is more to do than ever before, and you can get the game for a very reasonable price nowadays. Pick it up, if for no other reason to show game developers that fixing a \"broken\" game is worth it.",
