    text: "I know this game had an absolute ♥♥♥♥ storm at launch and for someone who pre-ordered this game, I was really underwhelmed. It was the most dry and empty game. But I seriously recommend you give it a shot. They have put a lot of time and effort into their game since launch. If it would have been advertised at a early access, I bet this game would be one of the most popular games right now. It has come such a far way. It really has become a fun game. For the people who want to explore, trade, mine, grind, become a pirate/bounty hunter I really recommend just giving it a shot now.",
